  "description": "Thread-safe, sorted, navigable dictionaries for .NET: a lock-free skip list (ConcurrentSkipListDictionary, a port of Doug Lea's ConcurrentSkipListMap) and an optimistic-lock-coupling B+ tree (ConcurrentBTreeDictionary). Linearizable point operations, weakly-consistent range views (GetViewBetween / Reverse) and navigable lookups (Ceiling/Floor/Higher/Lower). Validated on x64 and arm64.",
